  dialogue:
  - '"Well, it can be better to let some dreams stay in the clouds...."'
  - "Yeah\u2026 I don\u2019t really know anything about what it\u2019d be like to
    do that sort of job in real life.\r\nI\u2019m not so great at figuring out the
    mysteries when they\u2019re only fiction, either."
  responses:
  - Moodcontroller: {fileID: 0}
    responseText: Give it A Shot!
    dialogueObject: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 98cc1c14490d0834faf3c016c33110f3, type: 2}
    responseChange: 0
  - Moodcontroller: {fileID: 0}
    responseText: Don't Interfere.
    dialogueObject: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e26a89ea632c6fe47821dd3a9ea627d7, type: 2}
    responseChange: 1
